# Build artifacts. Reproducible from source; 11MB each, so they stay out of
# history. The .exe that goes to the reception PC is built fresh per release:
#   GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go build -ldflags="-s -w" -o dist/cleanlist.exe .
dist/*.exe
dist/cleanlist-linux
cleanlist
cleanlist.exe

# Live data. Written next to the executable at runtime. Never commit this —
# it is real occupancy data for a working hotel.
cleanlist-data.json
cleanlist-data.json.tmp
backups/

# Print verification output (see CLAUDE.md, "Verifying print output")
preview.pdf
*.png
